he middle of the day"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's 12 o clock! I am hungry! Time for lunch!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm starving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way to say that you are very hungry"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can we go for lunch? I'm starving!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "noon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "another way to say 12 p.m."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's have lunch at noon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "clerk"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who works in an office or a store"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to buy a sandwich. Let's ask the clerk for help."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "right away"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " immediately; now "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class = \"strong\">Anne</span>: Can I have a sandwich, please? <span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: Right away!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to buy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get a thing in exchange for money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She buys bread at the bakery."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Can you give me a hand?"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a request for help"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Could you give me a hand, please? I need help."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Wh - Questions with To Be"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The Wh-questions words are: what, when, where, who, and why.   You use them to ask for specific information. <br />The answer is NOT  yes or no. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"06\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question Word</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Use</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks about a person\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Who pays for lunch today?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks for information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What can I help you with?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks about time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">When is lunch?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks about a place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where is the lunch menu?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Why\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" asks about a reason\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why are you so hungry?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn1le02ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Do, Does and Can"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You often use Do, Does and Can to ask questions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use Do when the subject is I, you, we or they."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you like chocolate?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When the subject is he, she or it, you add DOES to the beginning of the sentence."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Does she like chocolate?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use CAN to ask someone to do something."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you help me?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Interview a family member about what they eat for lunch. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Start each question with: <ul><li>Who ...</li><li>What ...</li> <li>When ...</li> <li>Where ...</li> <li>Why ...</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the answers."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I can write about a family member. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can ask the <span class=\"italic\">Wh-</span> questions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can write down the answers. "}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [{"type": "tips", "content": []}], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn1le02ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: When is lunch? I'm starving! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Henry</span>:  \tWhy are you so hungry?", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:\t  \tBecause it's 12:00 p.m. I always eat lunch at noon.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Henry</span>: \tOkay. What is for lunch?", "id": 2, "time": "7000", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Let's read the menu and ask a clerk. Excuse me? Can you help us please?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Yes, of course. How can I help?", "id": 3, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Where is the lunch menu please?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:  Here it is.", "id": 4, "time": "26000", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Thanks. Can we have two sandwiches please?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Sure, right away.", "id": 5, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Henry</span>:  Ummmm ... Tom ... I have a problem.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: What? No money again? Who pays for lunch today?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Henry</span>: Could you give me a hand? Can you buy lunch ... again?", "id": 6, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn1le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn1le02ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "&bull; What is a Wh- question?", "id": 0, "time": "09000", "image": ""}, {"text": "&bull; What does it start with?", "id": 1, "time": "19000", "image": ""}, {"text": "&bull; When do you use Wh- questions?", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": ""}